OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA foggy morning in places,
OL,6,Fclear elsewhere but soon clouding over
OL,7,Fwith patchy light rain moving in from
OL,8,Fthe north. Initially light winds but
OL,9,Fstrengthening during the afternoon,
OL,10,Fespecially along the coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA mix of clear spells and
OL,13,Fcloudy periods. One or two showers of
OL,14,Frain, but most places will stay dry. A
OL,15,Fgentle breeze, windier along the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
